  <ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInOfficersDirectorsMajorSecurityHoldersAndVotingPowersOfTheRespondentTextBlock id="f-20" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;13. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt; Trevor I. Mihalik elected as Vice President, Chief Financial Officer &amp;amp; Director effective on &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt; 01/20/2025.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:12pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt; Christen M. Blend elected as Secretary effective on 03/15/2025&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:10pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt; Franz D. Messner, elected as Assistant treasurer effective on 04/12/2025.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:12pt;text-indent:-18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt; Marc B. Hunter, elected as Assistant treasurer effective on 04/12/2025.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:12pt;padding-left:36pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Robert B. Bernsten, elected as Vice President, Director effective on 07/14/2025 and Secretary effective on 08/30/2025 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:12pt;text-indent:-18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt; Heather M. Whitney, elected as Chief Accounting Officer and Controller effective on 08/02/2025.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:12pt;text-indent:-18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt; Douglas Wlodarski, elected as Assistance Vice President- Tax effective on 08/26/2025.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:12pt;padding-left:36pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Charles E. Zebula resigned as Vice President, Chief Financial Officer &amp;amp; Director effective on 01/19/2025&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:12pt;padding-left:36pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;David M. Feinberg resigned as Secretary effective on 03/14/2025&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:12pt;padding-left:36pt;text-indent:-18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt; Dana M. Koenig resigned as Assistant Vice President - Tax effective on 03/22/2025&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:12pt;padding-left:36pt;text-indent:-18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt; Noah K. Hollis, resigned as Assistant Treasurer effective on 03/28/2025&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:12pt;text-indent:-18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt; Therace M. Risch, resigned as Vice President effective on 04/01/2025.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:12pt;text-indent:-18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt; &#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160; David M. Feinberg, resigned as Vice President and Director as 07/13/2025.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:12pt;text-indent:-18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt; Kate Sturgess resigned as Chief Accounting officer and Controller effective as on 08/01/2025.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:12pt;text-indent:-18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt; Christen M. Blend resigned as Secretary effective as on 08/29/2025.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInOfficersDirectorsMajorSecurityHoldersAndVotingPowersOfTheRespondentTextBlock>
