:120%;padding-left:12.53pt"&gt;Includes investment securities loaned to borrowers under the securities lending program. See the &#8220;Investments Held in Trust for Future Liabilities&#8221; section of Note 1 for additional information.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="padding-left:27pt;text-indent:-22.5pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;(b)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:12.02pt"&gt;Amounts in &#8220;Other&#8221; column represent investments for which fair value is measured using net asset value per-share.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="padding-left:27pt;text-indent:-22.5pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;(c)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:12.53pt"&gt;Amounts in &#8220;Other&#8221; column primarily represent accrued interest, dividend receivables and transactions pending settlement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-bottom:5pt;text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;The following table presents the classification of OPEB plan assets for AEP within the fair value hierarchy as of December 31, 2025:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:100.000%"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="width:1.0%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:34.572%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.530%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:1.0%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:8.695%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width